# ===========================================================================
# Extra FreeRADIUS dictionary entries for CoovaChilli (WISPr) attributes.
# This small dictionary is merged into FreeRADIUS. The WISPr attributes are
# what let Chilli display the portal gateway address to the client, and what
# let it carry the session id used for MAC re-auth.
#
# TEMPLATE. Deploy to /etc/freeradius/3.0/dictionary (or a file included by it).
# ===========================================================================

# CoovaChilli / WISPr vendor dictionary (a portable subset).
VENDOR        ChilliSpot               14559
BEGIN-VENDOR  ChilliSpot
ATTRIBUTE     ChilliSpot-Ssid          1  string
ATTRIBUTE     ChilliSpot-DNSErrLifetime 14 integer chip
END-VENDOR    ChilliSpot

# WISPr (Wireless ISP Roaming) — used by CoovaChilli portal redirect.
VENDOR        WISPr                    14122
BEGIN-VENDOR  WISPr
ATTRIBUTE      WISPr-Redirection-URL             1     string
ATTRIBUTE      WISPr-Redirection-URL-2           2     string
ATTRIBUTE      WISPr-Session-Terminate-Time      3     integer
ATTRIBUTE      WISPr-Bandwidth-Max-Down          4     integer
ATTRIBUTE      WISPr-Bandwidth-Max-Up            5     integer
END-VENDOR    WISPr
